OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe technicians' strike at
OL,7,FThames Television continues.
OL,8,
OL,9,FTV-am transmissions are unaffected. The
OL,10,Fentire Thames TV schedule is blacked
OL,11,Fout.
OL,12,
OL,13,FViewers in the London area are
OL,14,Fpresented with a blue apology caption
OL,15,Fand silence.
OL,16,
OL,17,FHowever, London Weekend Television's
OL,18,Fschedule is transmitted as planned, on
OL,19,FFriday, Saturday and Sunday.
